# Cloudflare Pages' headers for every page and file of flyawait.com (security review of 2026-11-10; GitHub Pages ignores
# this file). HTTPS only for a year; no other site may put Flyawait in a frame (the app's captcha page opens in a web
# view of its own, not a frame); the powers the site never asks for are off (分享 and 複製 use none of them).
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()

# The skylines the apps read (scripts/skylines-json.mjs): a city drawn reaches them within minutes of a deploy.
/data/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=600
